---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="API · Refledger"
  description="Static JSON API for Refledger population, bindings, and point-in-time snapshots."
  canonicalPath="/docs/api"
>
  <h1>Public API v1</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Static JSON built with the site. No server, no token, no verdict fields. Every record carries the
    ledger seqs and observation windows behind it.
  </p>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Endpoints</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><code class="mono">/api/v1/index.json</code>: population, tip seq, last seal, public key, build time</li>
      <li><code class="mono">/api/v1/actions/{'{owner}'}/{'{repo}'}.json</code>: tags, current bindings, history</li>
      <li><code class="mono">/api/v1/tags/{'{owner}'}/{'{repo}'}/{'{tag}'}.json</code>: one tag</li>
      <li><code class="mono">/api/v1/at/{'{YYYY-MM-DD}'}.json</code>: what every watched tag pointed at at 00:00 UTC</li>
      <li><code class="mono">/api/v1/moved.json</code>: recorded moves</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      JSON Schemas live under <code class="mono">/api/v1/schemas/</code>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>curl</h2>
    <div class="pre-block">
      <pre><code>{`# Tip of the ledger and population counts
curl -sS https://refledger.gautamkhosla.com/api/v1/index.json | jq .

# Current bindings for an action
curl -sS https://refledger.gautamkhosla.com/api/v1/actions/actions/checkout.json | jq '.tags[] | {tag, pin_commit}'

# Point-in-time: every watched tip at 00:00 UTC on a sealed day
curl -sS https://refledger.gautamkhosla.com/api/v1/at/2026-10-01.json | jq '.bindings | length'`}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>JavaScript</h2>
    <div class="pre-block">
      <pre><code>{`const index = await fetch('/api/v1/index.json').then((r) => r.json());
const at = await fetch(\`/api/v1/at/\${index.last_seal_date}.json\`).then((r) => r.json());
const tip = at.bindings.find(
  (b) => b.repo === 'actions/checkout' && b.tag === 'v4',
);
console.log(tip?.commit_sha, tip?.evidence_seqs);`}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
